          How Much Electricity Does an <span class="text-[#38BDF8]">Air Purifier Use?</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Less than most people fear: a typical home unit running all day costs a few dollars a month. Here are the watts by speed, the arithmetic for your own rate, and the cost that actually adds up.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
